Dialogue: 3,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Before you ask —
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,100)}{\c&H88FF00&}[STEVE JOBS]:{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&HFFE800&}yes, that's an alien gunship{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 3,0:00:03.20,0:00:06.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}firing {\c&HFFE800&}plasma{\c&HFFFFFF&} outside my window next to my {\c&HFFE800&}Mustang{\c&HFFFFFF&}...
Dialogue: 3,0:00:06.68,0:00:09.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...and yes, our {\c&HFFA8D8&}AI agents{\c&HFFFFFF&} built my studio background too.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:09.28,0:00:14.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}What's happening behind me is {\c&HFFE800&}nothing{\c&HFFFFFF&} compared to what we just deployed at {\c&HFFE800&}Aria Technology Group{\c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:14.20,0:00:18.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We rolled out a new {\c&HFFA8D8&}Agentic Video Waiver{\c&HFFFFFF&} software to brand-new employees...
Dialogue: 3,0:00:18.90,0:00:22.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}...with {\c&HFFE800&}ZERO training{\c&HFFFFFF&}. No manuals. No onboarding sessions.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}{\c&H88FF00&}[STEVE JOBS]:{\c&HFFFFFF&} Instead of a rigid legacy screen, it runs on {\c&HFFE800&}generative, iterative UI{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 3,0:00:26.60,0:00:29.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}managed by {\c&HFFA8D8&}autonomous agents{\c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:29.65,0:00:32.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We hire an employee — they hit an {\c&HFFE800&}edge case{\c&HFFFFFF&} — it doesn't crash.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:32.90,0:00:36.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It {\c&H88FF00&}self-heals and adapts{\c&HFFFFFF&} in real time. {\c&HFFE800&}It's amazing.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 3,0:00:36.60,0:00:42.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}At {\c&HFFE800&}Aria Technology Group{\c&HFFFFFF&}, we're open-sourcing a massive part of this engine through {\c&H88FF00&}ariawave.tech{\c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:42.65,0:00:46.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But {\c&HFFE800&}open-source code{\c&HFFFFFF&} is NOT a production outcome.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:46.85,0:00:51.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This takes layers of {\c&HFFE800&}frontier intelligence{\c&HFFFFFF&}, enterprise safety guardrails,
Dialogue: 3,0:00:51.50,0:00:53.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and {\c&HFFA8D8&}seasoned professionals{\c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:53.50,0:00:56.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}That's why a partner like {\c&HFFE800&}Aria Technology Group{\c&HFFFFFF&} makes all the difference.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:56.25,0:00:57.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}{\c&H88FF00&}Reach out — and let's build.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
